      {
       "type": "heading6",
       "text": "",
       "spans": []
      }
     ],
     "page_section_element_body": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "Stepper is ideal for breaking down complex forms into manageable sections, guiding users through a series of introductory steps during onboarding processes, and assisting users in understanding the stages of e.g. a booking process.",
       "spans": [],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "Ensure each step has a clear and concise label that explains the action or content of that step. Avoid having too many steps as it can overwhelm users; keep it concise.",
       "spans": [],
       "direction": "ltr"
      },
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "text": "The Stepper module can be embedded in any UI, but it is generally more effective to use the full-width Stepper Section instead.",
       "spans": [
